      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Cardiological Society of India. Published by Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We herein describe a unique case of coronary artery perforation treated with covered stent with repeat cardiac tamponade resulting out of a fresh unexplained leak from a remote vessel (Ricochet) and successfully treated with intra-coronary injection of sterile synthetic glue, cyanoacrylate."
      },
